              "title": "Scorching Frost",
              "desc": "· Agent Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30 pts</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color> deals <color=#2BAD00>10% bonus</color> DMG.\n· After inflicting <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color> on enemies, enemy <color=#98EFF0>Ice RES</color> <color=#2BAD00>drops by 25%</color>, and Agents deal <color=#2BAD00>30% bonus</color> <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69013701": {
              "title": "Decree",
              "desc": "· Agent Sheer DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20%</color>.\n· After launching EX Special Attack, Agents with Rupture specialty deal <color=#2BAD00>50% bonus</color> CRIT DMG, and their <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> as well as <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color> ignore <color=#2BAD00>30%</color> of enemy <color=#F0D12B>Physical RES</color> on hit for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69013703": {
              "title": "Singular Blade",
              "desc": "· Agent Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20</color>, and Attribute Anomaly DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 10%</color>.\n· When inflicting an Attribute Anomaly on an enemy, the whole squad's CRIT DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 60%</color>, and the enemy's DEF <color=#2BAD00>decreases by 10%</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
            }
          }
